        "id": 18529
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-27T17:45:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. I was sort of half-assuming that this macro only worked on debug builds. I\u0027ll say that it has been useful in debugging this case and IWBN if we had a dynamic log verbosity system of some sort, so I could mark this message at a verbose/spammy level.",
      "parentUuid": "1f8cb263_964076e3",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 71,
        "startChar": 8,
