    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "48052afb_f0191eb8",
        "filename": "src/gpu/ganesh/dawn/GrDawnBuffer.h",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 40,
      "author": {
        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-27T13:56:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes you don\u0027t want the buffer to be mapped since the first thing you will do to it is copy a texture into the buffer. And I believe Dawn doesn\u0027t allow a buffer to be mapped while it is being used on the GPU. Though is pointed out later on, there is a bug where we\u0027ll hit an Assert when trying to map after the copy. This is a bug.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 39,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 40,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "492120f3571caae25c57418686f12d8ef872a8b9",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8f63225f_d045e60c",
        "filename": "src/gpu/ganesh/dawn/GrDawnBuffer.h",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 41,
      "author": {
        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-27T13:56:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think in an ideal world (i.e. Graphite) we would not store the fStagingBuffer inside a normal buffer. Instead each GrDawnBuffer will only ever have ownership of one wgpu::Buffer. Then outside code would be responsible for making staging buffers and issuing a copy command to send the data to the main gpu buffers. However, the way Ganesh is setup I think this would be hard to do since we have no way to trigger buffer to buffer copies higher up in the generic api agnostic code.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 41,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 41,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "492120f3571caae25c57418686f12d8ef872a8b9",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "f3383553_c45f4ba1",
        "filename": "src/gpu/ganesh/dawn/GrDawnBuffer.h",
        "patchSetId": 3
      },
      "lineNbr": 41,
      "author": {
        "id": 18529
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-27T17:45:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That makes sense and also refactoring Ganesh/Dawn code for this purpose is probably not worth the effort. I\u0027ll remove the TODO as it\u0027s not really actionable outside of having a better design for the Graphite version.",
      "parentUuid": "8f63225f_d045e60c",
      "range": {
